WEBVTT

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:13.970
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.860
A brand new world is beginning
Ima hajimarunda

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:24.440
Even if there are painful things ahead
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.840
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:38.600
I'm starting to walk in a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:44.830
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:48.050
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:51.180
And there's no one who can stop it
Darenimo tomerarenai

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:56.200
My heart is tightening and out of control
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:00.560
So start flapping your wings from here
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.610
And soar high up into the sky
Ano sora he to takaku

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:09.580
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:12.910
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:16.180
That's what I believed
Sou shinjiteiru no

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:21.340
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:44.600
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:52.200
Long ago, in the land of Deltora, there existed seven tribes.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:55.200
The Tora tribe,

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.200
The Dread Gnome tribe,

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.100
The Mere tribe,

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:00.550
The Plains tribe,

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:02.300
The Ralad tribe,

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.150
The Jalis tribe

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:06.200
And finally, the Del tribe.

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:11.600
Each of the seven clans possessed a gem which they had obtained from the earth.

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:15.550
Each of these seven gems held great magical power.

00:02:15.550 --> 00:02:17.200
But one day...

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.550
The dark ruler, the Shadow Lord,

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:27.500
Came from the mountains and attacked Deltora.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:35.900
The warriors of Deltora gathered and fought back against him.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:10.900
Then, a great hero appeared.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.980
His name was Adin; a blacksmith.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:17.600
One night, Adin had a strange dream.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.250
The dream told him:

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:23.800
'Take seven sheets of metal and beat them thin,

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.600
Creating a thin chain.'

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:31.000
After much hard work, the belt was completed.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:35.750
Adin approached the leaders of the seven clans

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:39.400
And asked them to place their gems into his belt.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:44.400
They all handed their gems to him,

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:47.600
Out of love for Deltora.

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:52.000
With the seven gems set into Adin's belt,

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.800
He fastened it around his waist.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:58.750
The belt shone brightly, just like the sun.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:03.740
Thus, the seven clans united under Adin.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:08.700
He annihilated the Shadow Lord's army,

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:12.230
And became the first king of Deltora.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:15.900
This is the history of how Deltora came to be.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:19.650
But, the Book of Deltora also says this:

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:24.450
"The Shadow Lord is sly and will never give up."

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:29.400
The belt was passed down from Adin through the generations of kings

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.500
And the country remained protected.

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:36.400
Because the country was peaceful for so long,

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:42.500
The kings let down their guard and stopped following the custom to wear the belt.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:50.200
The Shadow Lord was waiting for this moment.

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:02.350
The belt's gems were stolen,

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:06.050
These seven gems hidden in seven mystical places.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.900
Since then, the Kingdom of Deltora,

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:14.900
Dominated by the Shadow Lord, has
transformed into a wasteland filled with evil.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:18.700
Endon, the last king, was driven out of the kingdom,

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:21.800
And no one knows where he went.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:31.270
16 Years Later

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:47.500
Lief.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:49.500
Lief!

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:55.700
Lief!

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:56.500
Darling,

00:05:57.650 --> 00:05:59.900
Lief went down to the city.

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:01.100
The city?

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:04.400
Yes, today's a special day after all.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.450
Listen, all of you!

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:21.450
Today, this orchard belongs to the Shadow Lord.

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:25.100
From this day forth, you will not come anywhere near it.

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:29.900
I used to get my apples every year from the owner there...

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:32.500
Taking the fun away from our children like that...

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.100
How terrible...

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.600
Can I have an apple?

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:39.900
What was that?

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:40.950
Sweetie!

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:44.150
Please forgive us! She's still a child...

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.850
Those are my family's apples!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.650
You thief!

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:53.300
Everything here belongs to the Shadow Lord.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.550
If you disobey, you will be taken away.

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:57.250
P-Please no...

00:06:58.600 --> 00:06:59.800
Hey, Barda.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:05.900
We've been waiting for a long time,

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.050
But soon, that will be over.

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:09.880
I can feel it,

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:12.870
The time is soon to come.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:24.300
Who's there?!

00:07:27.100 --> 00:07:28.800
T-Too bright...

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:31.500
It belongs to that 'lord' because of the seal?

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:36.100
But, that apple doesn't have a seal,

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.650
Meaning, it belongs to no one.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.900
Grab him!

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:09.050
Shit!

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:12.650
Dear!

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:14.600
Dear, there's a problem!

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:15.800
What is it?

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:17.400
There's smoke coming from the markets.

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:18.290
There's what?

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:49.200
Huh?

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:00.450
Go and find him!

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:02.500
He's gotten away!

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:27.800
Fallow...

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.860
Oh, my lord.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:32.800
The Great Shadow Lord.

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:37.200
I sense something untoward in this kingdom of Del.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:42.900
Thanks to your decision to make use of the Grey Guards,

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.050
Things are going splendidly well.

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.950
And you are sure of this?

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:52.700
If there is anything that concerns you, then please, confide in me.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:56.700
I must ask, where might those seven gems you mentioned be hidden?

00:09:56.700 --> 00:10:01.200
If it is this matter which leaves my lord so troubled, then...

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.800
That matter is none of your concern!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.500
M-My sincerest apologies.

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:09.100
Do not become complacent.

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:11.600
Ensure that the guards remain wary.

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:13.100
Yes sir!

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:22.100
Barda, where's Father?

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:24.400
He is in the smithy, young master.

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:26.400
I told you to stop calling me that right?

00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:27.300
Lief is fine.

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:29.200
Lief!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.500
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:35.700
Looks like you got away from the guards.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.700
Lief!

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:39.700
Darling...

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:45.700
Father. Why are you all so cowardly?

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.200
The Book of Deltora states it:

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:51.950
"The only thing that can ward off the Shadow Lord is..."

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:55.300
"The Belt of Deltora", I know.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:59.300
Then, where is our king, King Endon?

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:02.000
For him to be gone while everyone suffers like this...

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:05.000
Lief...

00:11:06.200 --> 00:11:10.900
I memorised the Book of Deltora and learned a lot, but...

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:16.100
Father, I...

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.400
Barda.

00:11:20.050 --> 00:11:21.000
Yes.

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:24.100
Bring 'that' to me.

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:25.700
The time has come.

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:27.600
Very well.

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:40.050
Lief, go ahead and open it.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:43.500
What's wrong? Come.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.700
T-This is...

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.300
T-This is...

00:12:35.500 --> 00:12:37.700
The belt... shone!

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:40.900
The Belt of Deltora...?

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.150
That's right.

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:44.100
Why is it here?

00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:49.200
I used to live in Del castle.

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:53.700
Endon and I were raised by the same nursing mother.

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:56.500
With Endon?

00:12:56.500 --> 00:13:00.200
Yes. He is someone whom I can call a friend.

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:05.950
Lief's father, Jarred, told him about the days he spent with King Endon.

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:10.400
He then told the story of the day the Seven Ak-Baba attacked.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:15.650
That day, I took the broken belt,

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:22.300
And led King Endon and Queen Sharn out of the castle and to safety.

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:24.300
The king ran away?

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:25.900
No, not quite.

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:29.050
He was prioritising the safety of their lives.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:31.900
The lord would surely pursue them.

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:35.900
It was necessary to separate the king from the belt.

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:38.350
Because the belt was broken,

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:42.150
And the seven gems had been scattered.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:45.050
But, even if the gems are found...

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:46.450
That's right.

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:50.700
The power of the belt can only be wielded by royalty.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:55.000
The belt contains the spiritual power of the first king, Adin.

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:57.000
If there is no descendant of the king,

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:59.700
The belt will break apart on its own.

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:02.700
If that happens, it cannot be put back together.

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:06.050
That means... his bloodline is still...

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:09.600
Queen Sharn was pregnant back then.

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.150
That means...

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:14.750
When the seven gems are assembled in the belt,

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.750
The identity of his heir will be revealed.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:21.600
The seven gems are waiting for the king's successor...

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:26.930
King Endon knew he didn't have the power of a king.

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:32.150
So his successor is our only remaining hope.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:38.650
I will go.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.000
I'll find the gems,

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:44.250
And with the successor, confront the Shadow Lord,

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:47.900
And regain light and hope!

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:52.600
Mother?

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:55.400
Lief,

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:02.000
We've always been waiting for this day.

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:10.250
This is a map I made of Deltora using
information various travellers gave me.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:18.600
The seven Ak-Baba took the gems to the seven mystical places.

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:22.250
The Lake of Tears,

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:24.400
The City of the Rats,

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:26.850
The Shifting Sands,

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:29.100
Dread Mountain,

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:31.700
The Maze of the Beast,

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.850
The Valley of the Lost

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:37.100
And here, the Forest of Silence.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.100
The forest that's northeast of the city?

00:15:40.100 --> 00:15:41.400
That's right.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:43.600
You should head there first.

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:45.030
Okay.

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:45.950
Alright then.

00:15:45.950 --> 00:15:47.950
Now, take off your shirt.

00:15:48.400 --> 00:15:49.100
Huh?

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:54.250
Make sure to wear this at all times.

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:05.100
The belt entrusted to me has now been passed on to my son, Lief.

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:11.150
This is the best sword I have ever made thus far.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:19.350
I'm sure it will lend you power.

00:16:21.800 --> 00:16:23.250
This is from me.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.900
I sewed this for you.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:30.750
It's made with love and fond memories,

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:32.750
As well as strength and warmth.

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:37.700
This cloak is made with a special fabric.

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:39.900
I'll take great care of it.

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:43.400
Lief,

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:46.100
Happy 16th Birthday.

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:49.450
Thank you, Mother.

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:54.950
You've learned much, and have trained well.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.900
There's nothing for you to fear.

00:16:57.500 --> 00:16:58.850
Right.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:16:59.800
I'll leave immediately.

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:00.650
Wait.

00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:03.400
I'm going with you.

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:05.400
Oh, that's right.

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:06.500
Barda is...?

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:08.250
...Your companion.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:08.950
Huh?

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:17.380
Well then, are you surprised?

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:22.200
Now, let's go young master.

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:24.400
No, Lief, right?

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:31.600
I didn't know there was a secret path in the basement.

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:34.050
Where does it lead?

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:35.600
Well, various places.

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:37.600
Let's get out of here as soon as possible.

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.500
Make sure you stay behind me.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:45.130
I'm off.

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:47.350
Go on, Lief.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:50.050
I hope you make it back safely.

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:58.000
Take care, Lief...

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:16.400
Wait up, Barda.

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:19.100
Keep your voice down.

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:21.000
Just shut up and follow me, okay?

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:23.800
What's with the bossy attitude?

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:25.800
Alright then!

00:18:26.600 --> 00:18:27.700
I'll be going ahead!

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:28.900
Hey, Lief!

00:18:58.500 --> 00:18:59.700
Lief, get down!

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:18.350
His comrades will be coming, let's get moving.

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:26.600
I think we'll be fine here.

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:39.300
Barda,

00:19:39.300 --> 00:19:41.900
Thanks for saving me back there.

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:44.500
No need to thank me now.

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:47.900
I've been protecting you since you were a child.

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:48.500
Huh?

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:50.900
You never noticed, did you?

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.800
That was you?

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:56.700
Of course... that underground path!

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:59.500
I'm returning the favour to your old man.

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:02.400
When I escaped from the castle, he took me in.

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:04.300
You lived in the castle too?

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:06.000
Yeah.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.220
I was a palace guard.

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:25.750
I wasn't able to protect the belt until the very end on that day.

00:20:27.300 --> 00:20:28.400
Then,

00:20:28.900 --> 00:20:33.550
I encountered your parents, who were sending off two travellers.

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:37.000
I didn't know it at the time,

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:41.700
But those travellers were King Endon and Queen Sharn.

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:46.000
Since then,

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:48.800
My job has been to protect the belt,

00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:50.400
Not to babysit you.

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:52.600
I understand.

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:55.400
I'm not planning on being taken care of by you, you know.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:15.600
Barda.

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:19.100
Isn't there something close by?

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:21.000
It looks that way.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:33.300
B-Barda!

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:40.100
Are you sure they went this way?

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:41.600
There's no mistaking it;

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:43.350
Their footprints follow in that direction.

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:45.500
I see,

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:47.800
Then we won't need to pursue them.

00:21:55.200 --> 00:21:56.400
What are these things...

00:21:56.400 --> 00:21:57.330
Look forward!

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:02.700
M-My ears...!

00:22:03.100 --> 00:22:04.500
Shit...

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:14.550
You idiot, calm down!

00:22:26.200 --> 00:22:28.400
Barda!!

00:22:35.550 --> 00:22:41.050
Cherry blossom flowers are fluttering down
Sakura maiochite yuku

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:46.720
As if they were peeled from the sky
Sora kara hagareru you ni

00:22:47.600 --> 00:22:52.680
I'm gripping and holding hard
Anata to ita omoide ha

00:22:52.980 --> 00:22:58.450
The memories I have with you
Zutto gyutto dakishimeteru kara

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:05.750
All of a sudden, flower petals are in full bloom
Futto maue ni ukabu no ha

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:09.350
They're floating right above me
Mankai no hanabira

00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:17.130
No matter how long I wait, no one is coming
Mattetatte mou daremo konai

00:23:17.340 --> 00:23:24.100
Have I really left my wavering feelings behind?
Yureru omoi ha oitekitandeshou

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:32.340
I'm all alone right here, singing a song about cherry blossoms
Sakura uta utai nagara

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:38.280
Just waiting for no one else but you
Anata wo matsu watashi ha hitori

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:44.290
This love has taught something to me:
Kono koi ga oshiete kureta

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:50.600
That true love is hidden on ordinary days
Heibon na hibi koso ai to

00:23:50.600 --> 00:23:58.810
I present my last song to the spring breeze
Harukaze ni saigo no uta wo

00:24:06.100 --> 00:24:07.800
The Belt of Deltora.

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:13.600
A sacred belt adorned with the seven gems of the seven tribes passed down through royalty.

00:24:13.600 --> 00:24:19.400
When a true successor wears it, it will grant them enormous strength that will overpower even the Shadow Lord.

00:24:20.650 --> 00:24:24.400
Just as we set off on our journey, we
suddenly came across eerie monsters!

00:24:24.820 --> 00:24:26.340
What's with these guys?!

00:24:26.690 --> 00:24:30.570
Then in that moment, a mysterious girl appeared before us!

00:24:30.570 --> 00:24:31.190
The Girl of the Forest, Jasmine

00:24:31.190 --> 00:24:34.500
Next time, 'The Girl of the Forest, Jasmine'!
